  "body": "Experience luxury living at its finest in this beautifully crafted freehold home, where premium finishes, thoughtful design, and stunning bush views create an exceptional lifestyle. Light-filled interiors, elegant features, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow combine to offer both comfort and sophistication.\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\n* Designer kitchen with premium natural timber veneer finish\r\n* Premium Prada green natural stone\r\n* Built-in Gaggenau oven, microwave, and warming drawer\r\n* Gas hob plus hidden butler's pantry with additional cooking space\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n* Covered outdoor entertaining deck\r\n* Study nook with bespoke built-in cabinetry\r\n* Architectural floating staircase\r\n* Master bedroom featuring an oversized walk-in wardrobe and luxury ensuite\r\n* Marble sinks throughout\r\n* Solid Stone Bathtub\r\n* Master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Downstairs bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Premium smart Bidet toilets throughout\r\n* Custom cabinetry and feature lighting\r\n* Peaceful bush views\r\n\r\nLocated in the sought-after Long Bay community and zoned for Northcross Intermediate, Long Bay School, and Long Bay College. Enjoy the convenience of nearby BestStart Long Bay, Jetts Gym, November Eatery, Long Bay Medical Centre, New World Long Bay, public transport, and the stunning Long Bay Beach and Reserve, all just moments from your door.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/AMQF",
